                        "glosses": [
                            "In an obdurate manner; stubbornly, intractably or inflexibly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d83936ae-943f-460e-af48-1c2db64764fe",
                                "sense_id": "c4aceb24-29e4-3a28-b761-7c1e6c8702a5",
                                "text": "The sparse grey locks he combed were fewer and greyer: and though the accustomed mouth circle was as obdurately set as of old, his head waggled purposelessly: and his hands fumbled stiffly as he folded and replaced his pocket comb."
